eo|n|Wrongly used; perverted; misapplied. ; Given to misusing; also, full of abuses. ; Practicing abuse; prone to ill treat by coarse, insulting words or by other ill usage; as, an abusive author; an abusive fellow. ; Containing abuse, or serving as the instrument of abuse; vituperative; reproachful; scurrilous. ; Tending to deceive; fraudulent; cheating.	N:uk7,59,4~uk7,59,4
